between your eyes and get this over with.

27
00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:29,720
Only thing is, I still gotta
find out who the hell you are.

28
00:02:29,940 --> 00:02:32,837
We'll come back to the matter
of your girlfriend's fall later.

29
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:36,155
How do you know, Bucciarati,
and why did you follow me?

30
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,497
What are you...

31
